    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are proud to offer this beautiful one bedroom apartment to the market. Alexandra Walk offers a unique opportunity to reside in luxury in the heart of the city, it was built in c.2005 and was the final phase in the prestigious Adelaide Square development. \n\nNo.36 is a third floor apartment that has been excellently maintained and in superb condition throughout. Accomodation extends to a 41 Sq.M and comprises of a light filled living /dining area with access to your balcony. A high quality kitchen with Neff appliances and granite worktops, a double bedroom with integrated storage and spacious bathroom with a bath and overhead shower. \n\nA high level of specification and finish is indicative of quality throughout this development. Despite it's close proximity to Dublin's top facilities and networks, the development has managed to escape the clamour of the city's passing traffic. \n\nSituated on Whitefriar Street Alexandra Walk is within a 5 minute walk of the St. Stephen's Green area of Dublin city centre leaving a large selection of cafés, restaurants, shops and bars nearby. Trinity College Dublin, Royal College of Surgeons Ireland, Grafton Street and O'Connell Street are all within walking distance. The area is very well serviced by public transport with regular bus routes and the LUAS close by."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nLiving - 3.21m x 2.84m\n\n\nDining - 3.21m x 1.96m\n\n\nBedroom - 3.45m x 2.44m\n\n\nKitchen - 2.43m x 2.27m\n\n\nBathroom - 1.86m x 1.44m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> One bedroom, one bathroom apartment</li><li> Excellent condition throughout</li><li> Measuring c. 41 sqm/441sqft</li><li> 24 hour concierge</li><li> Gated and well maintained development</li><li> Lift access</li><li> B rated apartment</li><li> Grafton Street, Stephens Green, RCSI and Trinity are all within 10 minutes walking distance</li><li> A variety of cafes, restaurants, gyms and bars on your doorstep</ul>"
      },
      {
